@startuml
title Sending a Chat Message
participant Sender participant Messages.jsx participant WebSocket_/_DRF participant ChatConsumer participant PostgreSQL
Sender -> Messages.jsx : Open /messages/<user_id>/
Messages.jsx -> WebSocket_/_DRF : ws/chat/<id>/?token=... [API-090]
WebSocket_/_DRF -> ChatConsumer : can_chat_between recheck
ChatConsumer -> PostgreSQL : Persist Message; create notification
ChatConsumer -> Messages.jsx : chat_message / typing / presence frames
Messages.jsx -> Sender : Render message and receipt
@enduml
